  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Cross-regional Collaboration on Evidence-based Migration Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the enhancement of migration governance and strengthening cross-regional collaboration, with a focus on migrant protection and reintegration in North Africa by supporting effective migration management and enhancing protection data collection, through a whole-of-government and whole-of-society approach.</narrative>
